## Context

Tracker 1401. `scripts/transcript_spool.py:31-42` chooses the archive root by
probing for `/data/datasets/ours` (padme) and falls back to
`~/data/datasets/ours` (doudou): creating or losing that directory silently
moves or splits the store. Doudou's push drop-in
(`~/.config/systemd/user/transcript-archive.service.d/push-padme.conf`)
hardcodes both hosts' paths. `DATASETS_DIR` is now declared on both hosts in
`~/.config/environment.d/50-datasets.conf`.

## Exit criteria

- [x] `archive_root()` = `IDH_ARCHIVE_ROOT` (an empty value counts as unset), else `$DATASETS_DIR/ours/agent-sessions`,
      else the value parsed from `~/.config/environment.d/50-datasets.conf`, else
      a clear error; no directory probe, no hostname
- [x] Tests: each branch, including the error and the file fallback (no env)
- [x] Doudou push target derived from padme's declared location (documented in
      INSTALL.md), not a literal path pair; the drop-in updated on doudou
- [x] INSTALL.md and memo § 4.2 point to the variable and to the data READMEs
